---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service & 10-Year SLA | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Enterprise service level agreement (SLA), 99.9% uptime guarantee, 30-day statutory regulatory update terms, and software licensing conditions."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Enterprise Terms & SLA</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Terms of Service & <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">10-Year Managed Hosting SLA</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Standard service terms governing Enterprise DPP Software Licensing and Managed Sovereign Data Vault operations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1</span>
          <span>99.9% Platform Availability & Global Resolution SLA</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          EU DPP Provider guarantees 99.9% monthly availability for the GS1 Digital Link resolver and data carrier endpoints across European and global edge networks, with P95 latency &lt; 800ms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">2</span>
          <span>30-Day Mandatory EU Regulatory Adaptation</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          Whenever the European Commission publishes new delegated acts, amended PEFCR rules, or updated Registry data schemas, EU DPP Provider will adapt all managed schemas and software interfaces within 30 business days without interrupting active QR codes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">3</span>
          <span>Legal Desk & Agreement Inquiries</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          To request our enterprise master services agreement (MSA) or custom SLA addendum, please contact our legal desk:
        </p>
        <div class="neo-well p-4 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Legal & Enterprise Contracts</span>
          <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 hover:text-cyan-800 font-mono">
            info@eudppprovider.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
